{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-04-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'ABBOTT RECOMMENDS REJECTION OF BELOW-MARKET MINI-TENDER OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL INVESTMENT CORPORATION', 'text': "ABBOTT PARK, ILL., APRIL 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT) RECEIVED NOTICE OF AN UNSOLICITED MINI-TENDER OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL INVESTMENT CORPORATION (TRC) TO PURCHASE UP TO 1,000,000 ABBOTT COMMON SHARES, REPRESENTING APPROXIMATELY 0.06% OF THE COMPANY'S OUTSTANDING SHARES."}